<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg has no plans to raise capital.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg has no plans to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German specialty chemicals group SKW Trostberg AG said on Friday it did not plan to raise capital in the foreseeable future.</p>
<p>The group also said group sales could grow to around eight to nine billion marks within five years.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
